---
import {
  MapPin,
  Camera,
  QrCode,
  Check,
  ArrowRight,
  Sparkles,
  Clock,
  Globe,
  Rocket,
  TrendingUp,
  ShieldCheck,
  Star,
  MessageCircle,
} from "lucide-react";
---

<section id="servicios" class="py-24 relative reveal">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-28">

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         BLOQUE A: EXPLICACIÓN DIDÁCTICA ("¿POR QUÉ ESTAR EN GOOGLE?")
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-block">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-amber-300 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-900 shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]"
          >
            <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-zinc-900" />
            ¿Por qué estar en Google?
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2
          class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tighter leading-[1.05]"
        >
          HAZ QUE TE ENCUENTREN <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-rose-600">EN GOOGLE.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-zinc-700 text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Hoy tus clientes buscan en el mapa antes de comprar. Si tu negocio no aparece con buenas fotos y datos claros, se van con la competencia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Mini-Tarjetas de Proceso -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Paso 1 -->
        <div
          class="group bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-100 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]"
              >
                <MapPin class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-black font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-900 rounded-full text-zinc-700">
                PASO 01
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2.5 font-heading">
              1. Te ubicamos en el mapa
            </h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Creamos o reclamamos tu perfil oficial en Google Maps para que salgas cuando busquen tu rubro en tu comuna.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Paso 2 -->
        <div
          class="group bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:-rotate-6 transition-transform shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]"
              >
                <Camera class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-black font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-900 rounded-full text-zinc-700">
                PASO 02
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2.5 font-heading">
              2. Mostramos tu mejor cara
            </h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Subimos fotos reales de tu local o trabajo, horarios, precios y un botón directo a tu WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Paso 3 -->
        <div
          class="group bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]"
              >
                <QrCode class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-black font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-900 rounded-full text-zinc-700">
                PASO 03
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2.5 font-heading">
              3. Recibes clientes nuevos
            </h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Te entregamos un código QR físico para que tus clientes te dejen reseñas de 5 estrellas y subas en los resultados.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         BLOQUE B: GRILLA DE PLANES Y PRECIOS
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-block">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]"
          >
            Precios Claros y Transparentes
          </span>
        </div>

        <h3
          class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tighter leading-[1.05]"
        >
          PLANES CLAROS PARA <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-rose-600">TU NEGOCIO</span>.
        </h3>

        <p class="text-zinc-700 text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Inversiones accesibles pensadas para PyMEs chilenas. Sin cobros sorpresa, sin contratos de amarre y con resultados medibles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid 4 Tarjetas Principales (2x2) -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">

        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────
             TARJETA 1 (DESTACADA: MÁS ELEGIDO PARA EMPEZAR)
             ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div
          class="relative bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(225,29,72,1)] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(225,29,72,1)] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <!-- Badge Superior Destacado -->
          <div
            class="absolute -top-3.5 left-6 bg-rose-600 text-white text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full border-2 border-zinc-900 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] flex items-center gap-1.5"
          >
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white animate-pulse"></span>
            MÁS ELEGIDO PARA EMPEZAR
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="pt-2">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-100 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]">
                <MapPin class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-900 font-heading">
                Presencia en Google
              </h4>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm mt-1">
                Ideal si tu negocio aún no aparece en Google Maps o tiene un perfil incompleto.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Precio -->
            <div class="border-y-2 border-zinc-100 py-4 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight font-heading">
                  $29.990
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-700 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 inline-block">
                Pago único • Recuperas la inversión con 1 o 2 clientes nuevos
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Lista de Características -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 font-mono">
                Incluye todo esto:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Creación o reclamo y verificación oficial en Google Business</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Configuración de categorías y palabras clave de tu comuna</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Botón directo a tu WhatsApp, horarios y lista de servicios/precios</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Sesión y edición de 8 a 10 fotos reales de tu negocio</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Diseño de código QR listo para imprimir y pedir reseñas en tu local</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Botón CTA -->
          <div class="pt-8">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/56947185397?text=Hola%20Jamiro,%20me%20interesa%20el%20Pack%20Presencia%20en%20Google%20de%20$29.990"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-zinc-900 text-white hover:bg-rose-600 border-2 border-zinc-900 py-4 px-6 rounded-full font-bold text-base transition-all shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 text-center group"
            >
              <span>Quiero aparecer en Google</span>
              <ArrowRight class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>


        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────
             TARJETA 2: MANTENCIÓN MENSUAL GOOGLE
             ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div
          class="relative bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]">
                <Clock class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-900 font-heading">
                Mantención Mensual Google
              </h4>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm mt-1">
                Para dueños sin tiempo que quieren mantenerse activos en los primeros lugares del barrio.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Precio -->
            <div class="border-y-2 border-zinc-100 py-4 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight font-heading">
                  $19.990
                </span>
                <span class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-500 font-mono">/ mes</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700 bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-300 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 inline-block">
                Opcional • Sin contratos de permanencia
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Lista de Características -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 font-mono">
                Incluye cada mes:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Subida semanal de fotos nuevas y publicaciones de ofertas</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Respuesta profesional a todas las reseñas de tus clientes</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Actualización de horarios especiales o cambios de precios</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Reporte simple por WhatsApp con llamadas y clics recibidos al mes</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Botón CTA -->
          <div class="pt-8">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/56947185397?text=Hola%20Jamiro,%20quiero%20consultar%20por%20la%20Mantenci%C3%B3n%20Mensual%20de%20Google%20($19.990)"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-50 border-2 border-zinc-900 py-4 px-6 rounded-full font-bold text-base transition-all shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 text-center group"
            >
              <span>Consultar Mantención</span>
              <ArrowRight class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>


        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────
             TARJETA 3: PÁGINA WEB EXPRESS
             ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div
          class="relative bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-sky-100 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]">
                <Globe class="w-6 h-6 text-sky-600" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-900 font-heading">
                Página Web Express
              </h4>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm mt-1">
                Tu propio sitio web rápido y profesional optimizado para celulares.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Precio -->
            <div class="border-y-2 border-zinc-100 py-4 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight font-heading">
                  $89.990
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-800 bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 inline-block">
                Pago único • Lista en pocos días
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Lista de Características -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 font-mono">
                Incluye:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Landing page moderna diseñada a medida para tu rubro</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Presentación clara de servicios, galería de fotos y mapa integrado</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Botones directos de cotización a tu WhatsApp</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800">
                  <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 border border-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-700 stroke-[3]" />
                  </div>
                  <span>Optimización SEO local básica (el cliente solo paga su dominio .cl en NIC Chile)</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Botón CTA -->
          <div class="pt-8">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/56947185397?text=Hola%20Jamiro,%20me%20interesa%20la%20P%C3%A1gina%20Web%20Express%20de%20$89.990"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-50 border-2 border-zinc-900 py-4 px-6 rounded-full font-bold text-base transition-all shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 text-center group"
            >
              <span>Cotizar mi Web</span>
              <ArrowRight class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>


        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────
             TARJETA 4 (DESTACADA: AHORRA $10.000)
             COMBO DESPEGUE TOTAL
             ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div
          class="relative bg-white border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <!-- Badge Superior Destacado -->
          <div
            class="absolute -top-3.5 left-6 bg-amber-400 text-zinc-950 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full border-2 border-zinc-900 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)] flex items-center gap-1.5"
          >
            <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-zinc-900" />
            AHORRA $10.000
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="pt-2">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-200 border-2 border-zinc-900 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(24,24,27,1)]">
                <Rocket class="w-6 h-6 text-zinc-900" stroke-width={2.5} />
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-900 font-heading">
                Combo Despegue Total
              </h4>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 text-sm mt-1">
                Deja toda la base digital de tu negocio lista de una sola vez.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Precio -->
            <div class="border-y-2 border-zinc-100 py-4 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                <span class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight font-heading">
